### Swiver API examples (local mocked user alice / alice)
@auth = Basic alice:alice
@host = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4

### Current organization
GET {{host}}/organization/myOrganization()
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Dashboard key figures
GET {{host}}/finance/dashboard()
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Overdue sales invoices
GET {{host}}/sales/SalesInvoices?$filter=isOverdue eq true and IsActiveEntity eq true&$select=invoiceNumber,outstandingAmount,dueDate
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Record a partial payment
POST {{host}}/sales/SalesInvoices(ID=44444444-0000-4000-8000-000000000004,IsActiveEntity=true)/SalesService.recordPayment
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100, "paymentDate": "2026-10-03", "reference": "Partial payment" }

### ZUGFeRD PDF of a sent invoice
GET {{host}}/sales/SalesInvoices(ID=44444444-0000-4000-8000-000000000004,IsActiveEntity=true)/SalesService.zugferd(download=true)
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Import a bank statement CSV
POST {{host}}/finance/importBankStatement
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fileName": "sample.csv", "content": "Buchungstag;Betrag;Verwendungszweck\n03.10.2026;974,61;INV-2026-0004" }

### Estimated VAT of a period
GET {{host}}/finance/vatOverview(fromDate=2026-10-01,toDate=2026-10-31)
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Accountant export (ZIP)
GET {{host}}/finance/accountantExport(fromDate=2026-01-01,toDate=2026-12-31)
Authorization: {{auth}}
